  "description": {
    "raw": "This spell functions like summon monster, except it allows you to summon a single brimorak (Lords of Chaos 56), one incubus (Bestiary 3 73), one thoxel demon (see page 86), 1d3 schir demons (Bestiary 3 74), or 1d4+1 vermlek demons (Lords of Chaos 54).",
